mote sportsmanship and healthy recreation across the IISc community. Matches will be held during evenings and weekends.\nTo ensure the tournament runs strictly on schedule within the allotted days, the organizing committee will enforce a tight match schedule. Participants opting to play in multiple events must be prepared for the possibility of back-to-back matches across different categories. A strict no-delay policy will be maintained to ensure courts are fully utilized and the tournament concludes on time.", "eligibility": "UG, PG, PhD, PostDocs, Project Staff, Faculty, Administrative Staff, Support staff, and active members of IISc Community", "form_status": "open", "bracket_format": "single_elim", "form_close_date": null, "tournament_type": "open", "auto_reminders_enabled": false, "require_app_registration": false}', 'Changed tournament "Open Tournament" status to active', '2026-08-11 10:10:19.107096+00'),
